<title>INDIA: Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</title>
<headline>Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are monthly</p>
<p>annualised interest rates on forward dollar premia quoted by</p>
<p>banks</p>
<p>and brokers at 1600 IST. The rates are spot/one month to</p>
<p>spot/six</p>
<p>months.</p>
<p>	    O/N = 2.55%				    O/N = 2.55%</p>
<p>	    T/N = 8.94%				    T/N = 2.55%</p>
<p>		   Sept 12, 1996			Sept 11, 1996</p>
<p>	  1 month forward =  9.19%	1 month forward =  8.17%</p>
<p>	  2 month forward =  9.87%	2 month forward =  9.37%</p>
<p>	  3 month forward = 10.21%	3 month forward =  9.76%</p>
<p>	  4 month forward = 10.89%	4 month forward = 10.39%</p>
<p>	  5 month forward = 11.16%	5 month forward = 10.76%</p>
<p>	  6 month forward = 10.92%	6 month forward = 10.64%</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom, 91-22-265 9000</p>
